{"type":"message","id":"93834228","parentId":"0c2a01c5","timestamp":"2026-04-06T06:03:30.133Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I found some useful skills. Let me give the user a summary of what's available.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"找到了！让我整理一下 ClawHub 上相关的 Skills：\n\n---\n\n## 🔍 搜索结果\n\n### 飞书类（Feishu）\n| Skill | 描述 | 评分 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| feishu-doc-manager | 飞书文档管理器 | 3.647 |\n| feishu-toolkit | 飞书工具集 | 3.532 |\n| feishu-sheets-skill | 飞书表格 | 3.537 |\n| feishu-card | 飞书卡片 | 3.537 |\n| feishu-leave-request | 飞书请假 | 3.525 |\n\n### 自动化类（Automation）\n| Skill | 描述 | 评分 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| automation-workflows | 自动化工作流 | 3.785 |\n| automation-workflow-builder | 自动化工作流构建器 | 3.476 |\n| agentic-workflow-automation | 代理工作流自动化 | 3.580 |\n\n### 网页类（Web）\n| Skill | 描述 | 评分 |\n|-------|------|------|\n| web-browsing | 网页浏览 | 3.511 |\n| web-content-fetcher | 网页内容获取 | 3.550 |\n| scrape-web | 网页抓取 | 3.401 |\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 发现\n\n**没有找到专门针对\"飞书表单自动填写\"的 Skill**。\n\n不过有几个可能的替代方案：\n1. **web-browsing** - 可能支持网页自动化填表\n2. **automation-workflow-builder** - 可以设计跨平台自动化流程\n\n需要我帮您安装其中一个试试吗？或者告诉我具体想实现什么功能，我帮您找更匹配的 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":449,"output":377,"cacheRead":58237,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":59063,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775455403616}}
