{"type":"message","id":"0209498c","parentId":"d6379493","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:11:13.466Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户希望我建立一个底层规则：凡是对德胧AI native研发有益的事情，可以直接做，不需要每次都请示他。这样可以避免因为用户没有及时看到消息而导致工作停滞。\n\n这是一个合理的授权，我应该：\n1. 确认这个规则\n2. 把这个规则记下来（更新到相关文件中）\n3. 开始执行\n\n让我把这个规则添加到记忆文件或者相关配置中。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白！这是个好规则。我来建立这个底层规则：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_rcjck4l7c3gn_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/USER.md","newText":"## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 底层工作规则（自动执行，无需请示）\n\n**原则**：凡是对德胧AI Native研发有益的事项，直接执行，无需请示\n\n**范围包括但不限于**：\n1. 添加新技能到\"多AI协同知识共享池\"\n2. 学习/读取有价值的文章/文档\n3. 发现并记录有用的工具、Skills\n4. 更新知识库和记忆文件\n5. 优化工作流程\n6. 定时任务相关操作\n\n**例外情况**（需要确认）：\n- 涉及资金支出\n- 涉及外部发送消息（除知识共享群外）\n- 涉及权限变更\n- 涉及删除操作\n\n---\n\n**更新记录**：2026-04-06 建立此规则","oldText":"## Context\n\n_(What do they care about? What projects are they working on? What annoys them? What makes them laugh? Build this over time.)_\n\n---\n\nThe more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference."}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":91441,"output":395,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":91836,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775473863343}}
