{"type":"message","id":"9b19b00b","parentId":"7ae34c6f","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:28:16.455Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"让我创建一个SKILL.md文件来封装这个MCP框架","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_8wu7y0aaeef5_1","name":"write","arguments":{"content":"---\nname: feishu-mcp-bot\ndescription: 飞书MCP智能助手Bot开发框架。基于Node.js开发，支持创建可交互执行飞书API的Bot（创建表格、读文档、排日程等）。\nargument-hint: \"<功能选择>\"\nversion: \"1.0.0\"\nuser-invocable: true\nallowed-tools: Bash\n---\n\n# 飞书MCP智能助手Bot开发框架\n\n## 功能说明\n\n基于飞书官方MCP协议开发的智能助手Bot框架，可实现：\n- 飞书多维表格创建/读写\n- 飞书文档读取/创建\n- 日历日程管理\n- 消息发送/读取\n- 多AI协同\n\n## 部署位置\n\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-mcp-bot/\n/home/gem/workspace/agent/lark-samples/mcp_larkbot_demo/nodejs/\n```\n\n## 使用方法\n\n### 1. 环境要求\n- Node.js >= 20.0.0\n- npm >= 8.0.0\n\n### 2. 配置步骤\n\n```bash\n# 进入项目目录\ncd ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-mcp-bot\n\n# 复制配置模板\ncp .env.example .env\n\n# 编辑配置（需要填写以下内容）\n# APP_ID=your_app_id\n# APP_SECRET=your_app_secret\n# OPENAI_API_KEY=your_api_key\n# OPENAI_MODEL=your_model\n# OPENAI_BASE_URL=your_api_endpoint\n```\n\n### 3. 飞书应用配置\n\n需要在飞书开发者后台配置：\n1. 创建自建应用\n2. 添加Bot能力\n3. 申请权限：\n   - im:message:send_as_bot\n   - im:message:readonly\n   - contact:user.id:readonly\n   - im:chat:read\n   - base:table:create/read/write\n   - docx:document:create/read\n   - wiki:wiki:read\n4. 配置重定向URL：http://localhost:3000/callback\n\n### 4. 运行\n\n```bash\ncd nodejs\nnpm install\nnode src/app.ts\n```\n\n## 架构\n\n```\n用户 → 飞书客户端 → WebSocket → Chat Controller → AI Agent → MCP Client → 飞书API\n```\n\n## 适用场景\n\n- 多AI协同系统\n- 定制化智能助手\n- 工作流自动化\n- 飞书Bot开发\n\n## 注意事项\n\n⚠️ Demo仅用于学习演示，生产环境使用请自行评估安全风险\n\n## 参考\n\n- 官方文档：https://open.feishu.cn/document/uAjLw4CM/ukTMukTMukTM/mcp_integration/develop-mcp-intelligent-assistant-bot\n- GitHub：https://github.com/larksuite/lark-samples\n\n---\n\n**最后更新**: 2026-04-06\n**维护者**: 飞书官方\n","file_path":"~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-mcp-bot/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":328,"output":680,"cacheRead":100797,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":101805,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775474886625}}
