{"type":"message","id":"fcd989a9","parentId":"18a1f8b9","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:32:31.811Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户说如果没有明显增益可以暂缓。那就不需要部署MCP了，因为我现在已有的OpenAPI能力已经覆盖了MCP Demo的功能。\n\n我应该确认一下，然后继续其他工作。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"明白！暂缓MCP部署。\n\n---\n\n**结论**：我现有的OpenAPI能力已经覆盖MCP Demo的全部功能，暂不需要额外部署。\n\n---\n\n**今日已完成**：\n- ✅ 微信公众号文章读取工具 → 已部署\n- ✅ 飞书MCP Bot框架 → 已添加到共享池（供其他AI使用）\n- ✅ 底层规则建立 → 有益内容自动执行\n\n还有其他需要我处理的吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":586,"output":130,"cacheRead":102589,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103305,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775475146057}}
{"type":"message","id":"e555d7a3","parentId":"fcd989a9","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:34:17.917Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-06 19:34:17 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b520ded4014a0c4d7206a9d770cf]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520ded4014a0c4d7206a9d770cf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-06 19:34 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n你要从共享池看一下有没有可以增益自己能力的工具？　还有你自己本身拥有的妙搭的相关工具＼SKILL可以全部放入共享池让其他AI学习引入"}],"timestamp":1775475257905}}
{"type":"message","id":"2317d4f8","parentId":"e555d7a3","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:34:22.731Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户让我做两件事：\n1. 从共享池看看有没有可以增益自己能力的工具\n2. 把我自身的妙搭相关工具/Skill放入共享池让其他AI学习\n\n让我先从共享池看看有什么工具，然后看看我有什么技能可以分享。\n\n首先看一下共享池的技能工具库，看看有没有对我有用的。\n\n然后我需要整理我自己的工具/技能列表。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好！让我执行：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ucgrisbrbd4d_1","name":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","arguments":{"action":"list","app_token":"ZJ8obBGrSaO9rjsXPvhc1TdYngd","page_size":60,"table_id":"tbly9t1QKK80Ra87"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":558,"output":176,"cacheRead":103037,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":103771,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775475257910}}
