{"type":"message","id":"6fef9b0a","parentId":"6cb9b6de","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:34:41.871Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"FlyAI CLI没有安装。这是一个可以增益的能力。让我看看能不能安装并学习使用。不过用户说先暂缓，先完成第二个任务：把我自身的妙搭工具/Skill放入共享池。让我检查一下我有哪些妙搭/飞书工具，确保它们都在共享池里。从共享池来看，已经有很多lark-xxx的技能了。让我确认一下是否完整。已有的lark技能：\n- lark-doc ✓\n- lark-base ✓\n- lark-wiki ✓\n- lark-sheets ✓\n- lark-calendar ✓\n- lark-im ✓\n- lark-task ✓\n- lark-contact ✓\n- lark-mail ✓\n- lark-drive ✓\n- lark-vc ✓\n- lark-whiteboard ✓\n- lark-event ✓\n- lark-workflow-meeting-summary ✓\n- lark-workflow-standup-report ✓\n- lark-shared ✓\n- lark-skill-maker ✓\n- lark-openapi-explorer ✓\n\n还有一些更上层的技能：\n- 飞书文档全能力处理 ✓\n- 飞书多维表格 (lark-base)\n- 飞书会议纪要自动生成\n- 飞书Toolkit看起来已经挺全的了。让我再看看有没有遗漏的。\n\n让我列出我实际有的能力，对照共享池：\n\n1. 飞书IM消息 - 已共享(lark-im)\n\n\n2. 飞书日历 - 已共享(lark-calendar)\n3. 飞书任务 - 已共享(lark-task)\n4. 飞书多维表格 - 已共享(lark-base)\n5. 飞书文档 - 已共享(lark-doc)\n6. 飞书Wiki - 已共享(lark-wiki)\n7. 飞书搜索 - 需要确认是否在共享池\n8. 飞书云盘 - 已共享(lark-drive)\n\n大部分核心能力都已经同步到共享池了。现在需要检查飞书搜索功能是否已经包含。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_uyv4gyquwhdw_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"ls -la ~/workspace/agent/skills/ | grep -i feishu"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":407,"output":450,"cacheRead":113341,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":114198,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775475273952}}
