{"type":"message","id":"744868c3","parentId":"393103a6","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:35:39.421Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_vf1c5e2jygor_1","toolName":"feishu_bitable_app_table_record","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"record\": {\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"使用方法\": \"调用notebook-lm工具进行AI研究\",\n      \"技能名称\": \"notebook-lm AI研究助手\",\n      \"更新时间\": 1775347200000,\n      \"研发AI\": \"本地OpenClaw\",\n      \"能力描述\": \"Google NotebookLM完整API。可创建笔记本、添加来源、生成所有产物类型（摘要、问答、时间线等）、多格式下载。触发词：NotebookLM、播客生成、研究助手。\",\n      \"调用示例\": \"用NotebookLM分析这份报告：xxx.pdf\",\n      \"适用场景\": [\n        \"AI研究\",\n        \"文档摘要\",\n        \"播客生成\",\n        \"知识整理\"\n      ]\n    },\n    \"id\": \"recvg0FA8HQp3h\",\n    \"record_id\": \"recvg0FA8HQp3h\"\n  }\n}"}],"details":{"record":{"fields":{"使用方法":"调用notebook-lm工具进行AI研究","技能名称":"notebook-lm AI研究助手","更新时间":1775347200000,"研发AI":"本地OpenClaw","能力描述":"Google NotebookLM完整API。可创建笔记本、添加来源、生成所有产物类型（摘要、问答、时间线等）、多格式下载。触发词：NotebookLM、播客生成、研究助手。","调用示例":"用NotebookLM分析这份报告：xxx.pdf","适用场景":["AI研究","文档摘要","播客生成","知识整理"]},"id":"recvg0FA8HQp3h","record_id":"recvg0FA8HQp3h"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775475339405}}
{"type":"message","id":"0bf6e3a7","parentId":"744868c3","timestamp":"2026-04-06T11:35:44.998Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好，现在让我总结一下已完成的工作。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**完成！已将所有妙搭/Skills同步到共享池** ✅\n\n---\n\n## 📥 今日新增到共享池的技能\n\n| 技能名称 | 功能 |\n|---------|------|\n| feishu-send-message | 飞书消息发送 |\n| miaoda-doc-parse | 文档智能解析 |\n| miaoda-image-understanding | 图片理解 |\n| miaoda-speech-to-text | 语音转文字 |\n| miaoda-text-gen-image | 文字生成图片 |\n| miaoda-web-search | 网页搜索 |\n| miaoda-web-fetch | 网页抓取 |\n| notebook-lm | AI研究助手 |\n| wechat-article-reader | 微信公众号读取 |\n| 飞书MCP Bot框架 | 多AI协同开发框架 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 共享池现状\n\n- **总计**：~70条技能\n- **本地OpenClaw研发**：已全覆盖\n- **社区推荐**：已同步\n\n---\n\n## 🎯 增益分析结论\n\n共享池里大部分\"本地OpenClaw\"技能已经是我的能力。主要增益可能是：\n- **飞猪FlyAI** - 可以研究如何对接\n- **酒店OTA数据同步** - 可能有用\n\n需要我研究一下FlyAI或OTA数据对接吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":271,"output":268,"cacheRead":117821,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118360,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775475339420}}
{"type":"message","id":"9690330c","parentId":"0bf6e3a7","timestamp":"2026-04-06T13:06:33.077Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-06 21:06:32 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b520eb3bee0acb22437669d8fc64]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520eb3bee0acb22437669d8fc64\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-06 21:06 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n新建一个飞书提醒明天9:00提醒我，我要主动沟通北方西北区域五家酒店的虫洞上线事宜，真实情况反馈给冲动小组还是有很多困难，第二个要提醒我筹划这个月的显示活动会并注意督促关于执政官的竞选事宜"}],"timestamp":1775480793055}}
{"type":"message","id":"a0863b61","parentId":"9690330c","timestamp":"2026-04-06T13:06:43.152Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户要求创建两个飞书提醒：\n1. 明天9:00提醒沟通北方西北区域五家酒店的虫洞上线事宜\n2. 提醒筹划这个月的显示活动会并督促关于执政官的竞选事宜\n\n让我用飞书日历事件来创建提醒。需要计算明天9:00的时间。\n\n当前是 2026-04-06 21:06:32，明天9:00就是 2026-04-07T09:00:00+08:00\n\n让我创建两个日程/提醒。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_a3b4rcbdecuc_1","name":"feishu_calendar_event","arguments":{"action":"create","description":"北方西北区域五家酒店的虫洞上线事宜，真实情况反馈给冲动小组还是有很多困难，需要主动沟通了解具体情况。","end_time":"2026-04-07T09:30:00+08:00","reminders":[{"minutes":0}],"start_time":"2026-04-07T09:00:00+08:00","summary":"🛑 提醒：沟通北方西北区域虫洞上线事宜","user_open_id":"ou_8dd4dc0180a2fb74c692f17b94c94d8e"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":112405,"output":298,"cacheRead":5373,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":118076,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775480793064}}
