{"type":"message","id":"7454731b","parentId":"80784d03","timestamp":"2026-04-06T13:44:48.961Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，沟通记录表格已创建并导入了群成员。现在需要在群里发送模拟预约消息。让我发送一条消息到群里测试。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_vr5qgpazb8cd_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"text\": \"【沟通模拟测试】\\n\\n各位同事大家好！\\n\\n为了更好地推进虫洞AI工作效率提升工作，我计划于明天（4月7日）与各位进行一对一的线上沟通，沟通时间约10分钟。\\n\\n主要沟通事项：\\n1. 🚀 4月24日店总回家日活动动员\\n2. 💡 虫洞AI上线征询意见\\n3. 🤝 虫洞小组工作配合探讨\\n4. 🏆 执政官竞选动员\\n5. 🦞 妙搭龙虾AI工具推广\\n\\n请各位方便的时间，我会逐一与大家对接。感谢配合！\\n\\n（此为模拟测试消息，仅用于流程演练）\"}","msg_type":"text","receive_id":"oc_7fbb3e67d82d905ffbee225f3a66d765","receive_id_type":"chat_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":5443,"output":276,"cacheRead":121405,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":127124,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775483079581}}
