{"type":"message","id":"1bf56c23","parentId":"c32657d0","timestamp":"2026-04-06T14:15:40.597Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"找到了北方西北区域店总会议的成员，共10位店总（除了晁留柱）。现在我需要：1. 设置明天9:00的定时任务给虫洞效率群发会议邀约2. 搜索竞品酒店信息做调研报告让我先用flyai搜索北方区域的酒店信息。根据之前共享池里的技能，我有flyai命令可以使用。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gqx3jla09q47_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which flyai || ls ~/.local/bin/ 2>/dev/null | grep -i flyai"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":916,"output":120,"cacheRead":130365,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":131401,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775484935510}}
