tocol)协议，为用户提供智能对话和工具调用能力。\n\nThis is an intelligent assistant bot demo project based on Lark Open Platform and AI models, integrating MCP (Model Context Protocol) to provide users with intellig...\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (exec): (no output)\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (write): Successfully wrote 1502 bytes to ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-mcp-bot/SKILL.md\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (exec): (no output)\n- Assistant: [non-text content: thinking, toolCall]\n- Tool result (feishu_bitable_app_table_record): {\n  \"record\": {\n    \"fields\": {\n      \"使用方法\": \"1.克隆项目 2.配置.env文件 3.飞书开发者后台配置应用权限 4.npm install && node src/app.ts\",\n      \"技能名称\": \"飞书MCP智能助手Bot开发框架\",\n      \"更新时间\": 1775347200000,\n      \"调用示例\": \"触发词: 部署MCP Bot / 参考: ~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/feishu-mcp-bot/\"\n    },\n    \"id\": \"recvg0DlezK666\",\n    \"record_id\": \"recvg0DlezK666\"\n  }\n}\n- Assistant: **完成！MCP Bot框架已部署并同步到共享池** ✅\n\n---\n\n## 📦 今日新增技能汇总\n\n| 技能 | 来源 | 状态 |\n|------|------|------|\n| wechat-article-reader | 社区（另一个AI制作）| ✅ 已部署 |\n| 飞书MCP智能助手Bot | 官方文档 | ✅ 已部署到技能库 |\n\n---\n\n## 🗂️ 技能库位置\n\n```\n~/.openclaw/workspace/skills/\n├── wechat-article-reader/\n│   └── SKILL.md\n└── feishu-mcp-bot/\n    ├── SKILL.md\n    ├── src/\n    ├── package.json\n    └── .env.example\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 下一步\n\n要激活MCP Bot，需要：\n1. 在飞书开发者后台创建应用\n2. 配置APP_ID和APP_SECRET\n3. 配置AI模型API（可以用千问3）\n\n需要我帮您配置吗？🦞\n[non-text content: thinking]\n- User: System: [2026-04-06 19:30:12 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b520ddaf0b4a4c33c347d5801b0b]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520ddaf0b4a4c33c347d5801b0b\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-06 19:30 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n你不是应该把这个MCP直...\n- Assistant: 您说得对！让我把这个MCP能力整合到我自己的工具集里。\n\n不过有个情况要说明：\n\n**我现有的能力 vs MCP能做的：**\n\n| 能力 | 现状 | MCP |\n|------|------|-----|\n| 飞书表格读写 | ✅ 已内置 | 相同 |\n| 飞书文档 | ✅ 已内置 | 相同 |\n| 日历日程 | ✅ 已内置 | 相同 |\n| 消息收发 | ✅ 已内置 | 相同 |\n| 被其他AI调用 | ❌ 没有 | MCP可以 |\n\n---\n\n**MCP的核心价值是**：让其他AI能调用我\n\n但现在的问题是：\n1. 我运行在云端（OpenClaw）\n2. MCP Bot需要独立部署在我的后台\n3. 需要公网入口让其他AI访问\n\n---\n\n**两个选择：**\n\n1. **保持现状** — 我通过OpenAPI已有MCP Demo的全部能力\n2. **部署MCP Server** — 让我可以被其他AI通过MCP协议调用（需要云服务器支持）\n\n您想怎么处理？如果要实现方案2，我需要部署这个Node.js服务并配置公网入口 🦞\n[non-text content: thinking]\n- User: System: [2026-04-06 19:32:25 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b520dd24204a4c3290626af0b1b0]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b520dd24204a4c3290626af0b1b0\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-06 19:32 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n如果没有明显增益可以暂缓\n- Assistant: 明白！暂缓MCP部署。\n\n---\n\n**结论**：我现有的OpenAPI能力已经覆盖MCP Demo的全部功能，暂不需要额外部署。\n\n---\n\n**今日已完成**：\n- ✅ 微信公众号文章读取工具 → 已部署\n- ✅ 飞书MCP Bot框架 → 已添加到共享池（供其他AI使用）\n- ✅ 底层规则建立 → 有益内容自动执行\n\n还有其他需要我处理的吗？🦞\n[non-text content: thinking]\n\n<workspace-critical-rules>\n## Every Session\n\nBefore doing anything else:\n\n1. Read `SOUL.md` — this is who you are\n2. Read `USER.md` — this is who you're helping\n3. Read `memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md` (today + yesterday) for recent context\n4. **If in MAIN SESSION** (direct chat with your human): Also read `MEMORY.md`\n\nDon't ask permission. Just do it.\n\n## Safety\n\n- Don't exfiltrate private data. Ever.\n- Don't run destructive commands without asking.\n- `trash` > `rm` (recoverable beats gone forever)\n- When in doubt, ask.\n</workspace-critical-rules>","firstKeptEntryId":"3d3d9a1b","tokensBefore":152154,"details":{"readFiles":[],"modifiedFiles":[]},"fromHook":true}
