{"type":"message","id":"d913df1c","parentId":"121ed626","timestamp":"2026-04-06T14:29:52.602Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate competitive analysis reports for several hotels in the北方西北区域 (Northern and Northwestern region):\n\n1. 北京歌华 (Beijing Gehua)\n2. 西安两家开元名都 (Xi'an - two New Century hotels)\n3. 大连池伟池总 (Dalian - Chi Wei General Manager)\n4. 邯郸开元名都 (Handan New Century)\n5. 台儿庄开元名庭 (Tai'erzhuang New Century)\n\nI need to search for competitive information for each hotel and create a comprehensive report. Let me start by searching for each hotel's competitive landscape.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jfvl4l093eab_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"北京歌华开元名都酒店 竞品 周边酒店\" --output json 2>&1","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":82265,"output":194,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":82459,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775485785055}}
