{"type":"message","id":"524b5170","parentId":"a9f2f3dc","timestamp":"2026-04-06T14:36:24.791Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"完成了！现在汇总报告有了每家酒店的详细链接，大连迟伟总的信息也更新了。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"**已更新！** ✅\n\n---\n\n## 📄 汇总报告（含6家酒店详细链接）\n\n**链接**：https://www.feishu.cn/docx/Opb7dqFzoo7jxCxTszUc7xfXnAe\n\n---\n\n## 📋 各酒店详细报告链接\n\n| 序号 | 酒店 | 详细报告 |\n|:---:|------|---------|\n| 1 | 北京歌华开元大酒店 | [查看](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/Zp4xdOtJrokUO6xNr6bcqvjKnMb) |\n| 2 | 西安钟楼开元名都酒店 | [查看](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/GX9GdL6rSodImAxSggjcoCgRnO9) |\n| 3 | 西安西藏大厦开元名都大酒店 | [查看](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/SUu4dR12Fo463LxN03pcdftZn9n) |\n| 4 | **大连开元曼居（市政府的店）** | [查看](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/RFlIdB9i7oJwTpxHolDc50e8nHa) |\n| 5 | 邯郸开元名都酒店 | [查看](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/TK90dHnpBozUIlxZOyscwzYqnmf) |\n| 6 | 台儿庄古城开元名庭大酒店 | [查看](https://www.feishu.cn/docx/IxEhd9jQ1opoKVxZloWcn1xWnrf) |\n\n---\n\n## 📌 修正说明\n\n**关于大连迟伟总**：\n- 迟伟总是 **大连开元曼居·大连市政府店** 的负责人\n- 地址：西岗区新开路78号（紧邻市政府、人民广场）\n- 该店也常被称为\"大连东关街人民广场店\"，是同一个位置\n\n---\n\n现在可以点击汇总报告中的链接查看每家酒店的详细竞品分析！🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":293,"output":468,"cacheRead":104829,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105590,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775486177053}}
{"type":"message","id":"54d1526e","parentId":"524b5170","timestamp":"2026-04-06T14:42:00.719Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-06 22:42:00 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b52082db788a4b2dfa087b16cbaf]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52082db788a4b2dfa087b16cbaf\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Mon 2026-04-06 22:42 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n为什么每家店的竞品分析这么单薄？你对比天津的看看👀"}],"timestamp":1775486520710}}
{"type":"message","id":"bb168699","parentId":"54d1526e","timestamp":"2026-04-06T14:42:08.611Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking why each hotel's competitive analysis is so thin compared to the Tianjin report I did earlier. They're right - the later reports were much more detailed with price monitoring, user reviews, strengths/weaknesses analysis, etc.\n\nI should regenerate each hotel's report with the same depth as the Tianjin report - with real OTA data, pricing, user reviews, detailed competitor analysis, etc.\n\nLet me redo this properly with more detailed research for each hotel.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"您说得对！我重新用深度调研方式生成每家酒店的详细报告：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_o0dtmwuwp462_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"miaoda-studio-cli search-summary --query \"北京歌华开元大酒店 携程 点评 价格 评分\" --output json 2>&1","timeout":60}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":105340,"output":175,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":105515,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775486520715}}
{"type":"message","id":"5081dc8a","parentId":"bb168699","timestamp":"2026-04-06T14:42:09.904Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_o0dtmwuwp462_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"北京歌华开元大酒店预订价格,联系电话位置地址【携程酒店】\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hotels.ctrip.com/hotels/369673.html\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"4.8\\n4.8\\n4.7\\n4.8\\n早餐种类丰富，中西式搭配合理，口味也很不错。员工服务意识较强，响应及时，遇到问题能较快解决，态度礼貌周到。性价比很高，综合考虑位置、设施和服务，价格属于合理范围，适合商务出行或短期住宿。额外服务还提供了免费行李寄存和延迟退房，这点非常人性化，值得肯定。总体来说各方面都很不错！很推荐！\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"携程酒店-北京歌华开元大酒店预订-北京歌华开元大酒店价格、点评、电话、地址查询-【携程旅行手机版】\",\n      \"url\": \"https://mm.ctrip.com/webapp/hotels/detail?hotelid=369673\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"北京歌华开元大酒店\\n\\n2008年开业\\n\\n室内恒温泳池\\n\\n动人夜景\\n\\nSPA\\n\\n中式餐厅\\n\\n瑜伽课程\\n\\n拍照出片\\n\\n健身室\\n\\n家庭房\\n\\n免费迷你吧\\n\\n设施\\n政策\\n\\n4.8\\n超棒\\n“设施齐全舒适，位置交通便利”\\n\\n距安华桥地铁站步行260米,约4分钟 | 朝阳区北三环鼓楼外大街19号\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"北京歌华开元大酒店\",\n      \"url\": \"https://hk.trip.com/hotels/beijing-hotel-detail-369673/gehua-new-century-hotel-beijing/?checkin=2022-12-22\\u0026checkout=2022-12-23\\u0026city=1\\u0026from_page=list\\u0026link=button\\u0026module=list\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"9.5/10 非常好\\n非常好\\n9.5/10\\n\\n真實住客...\\n探索北京歌華開元大酒店，一家位 北京的5星級住宿。根據 3499 則評價，這間酒店獲得 9.5/10 的高分，以超卓的品質和物有所值的價格脫穎而出，房價每晚由 HK$715 起。\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"{}\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=165383345\\u0026hidePublishButton=true\\u0026hideTitle=true\\u0026allianceid=7144873\\u0026sid=263483165\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"{\\\"打卡景点\\\":\\\"北京歌华开元大酒店\\\",\\\"城市\\\":\\\"北京\\\",\\\"笔记正文\\\":\\\"中轴路标志性酒店——帝都中轴线之星光✨北京歌华开元大酒店，占据了城市中轴线c位，妥妥的气质担当！📍酒店亮点盘点：1.**帝王视角**：正对奥体公园，躺在浴缸里就能看鸟巢夜景🌌，推荐选高层北向房型！2.**艺术范儿十足**：大堂那幅巨型泼墨山水画绝了，随便一拍就是杂志大片�...\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"Reviews of Gehua New Century Hotel Beijing\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.trip.com/hotels/beijing-hotel-detail-369673/gehua-new-century-hotel-beijing/review.html\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"9. 5 /10 Outstanding 3535 reviews\\n9.6\\nService\\n9.6\\n8.5/10\\nVery good\\nThe location is great, within a short walking distance to the metro and restaurants. The pool is pleasant and normally not busy. Service level is ok, delivery services are not facilitated and can be...\\n10/10\\n9.5/10\\nAmazing\\n10/10\\n10/10\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"北京歌华开元酒店真实入住体验报告-飞客茶馆 - FLYERT - 手机版\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.flyert.com.cn/tag/%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E6%AD%8C%E5%8D%8E%E5%BC%80%E5%85%83\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"客房 1000元的房间，金卡入住，面积很小，35左右...\\n[htitle=一,抵达酒店]众所周知的原因，京城酒店工作日经常贵的离谱，之前五六两天住泰富酒店1200已经觉得毫无性价比了，周日到周一一看价格又更上新台阶，打开开元app一看，北京的开元竟然配合优惠券只要600！还送4000东航，而且离泰富酒店超级近。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"北京歌华开元大酒店信息总览 | 一站式了解\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.agoda.cn/zh-cn/gehua-new-century-hotel/hotel/beijing-cn.html?checkin=2025-06-19\\u0026checkout=2025-06-20\\u0026children=0\\u0026cid=1811826\\u0026searchrequestid=f5b95b6f-0c1c-43ff-8926-1243f71076dc\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"北京歌华开元大酒店\\n酒店\\n等级为5\\n9.5 惊艳了\\n3,827 个评分\\n距离公交设施...\\n\\n8.3 位置优越\\n鼓楼外大街19号, 马甸和安贞, 北京, 北京, 中国, 100120\\n（距市中心1.76公里）\\n停车服务\\n免费\\nfinal price: RMB 710\\nRMB 710\\n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"北京歌华开元｜中轴线五星传媒酒店，俯瞰鸟巢超绝✨\",\n      \"url\": \"https://m.ctrip.com/webapp/you/community/detail?articleId=266569129\\u0026hidePublishButton=true\\u0026hideTitle=true\\u0026allianceid=7144873\\u0026sid=263483165\",\n      \"site_name\": \"\",\n      \"publish_time\": \"\",\n      \"summary\": \"{\\\"打卡景